        <span style="color:Pink"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span> and you shake on it, agreeing to meet on Saturday. He then departs, smiling so wide it’s kind of cute. You even notice him give a little hop as he walks away.</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:BlueViolet">But you can’t shake the feeling you are about to get involved in something that will change your perception of reality forever.</span> <br>
