        <span style="color:BlueViolet">You blink and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span> is gone. No sign of him or the photo. Photo? Why are you thinking about a photo?</span> <span style="color:Yellow">Dang, you must be really Tired.</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">Anyway, time to play on the playground and enjoy your lunch break!</span> <br>
